== Trivia ==
*After speaking to '''Tarwen''', or one of the others in the [[Dwarven Tavern|tavern]], typing "burp" in public chat will cause [[Hornum]] to reward the player with a [[Dwarven Tankard]].
**Typing party chat, guild chat, or private chat will not work.

